face":"驃騎諮議參軍","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p001:m0026","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-092","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi","source_id":"s-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi-ws2195614","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p001","quote":"阮長之字茂景，陳留尉氏人也。祖思曠，金紫光祿大夫。父普，驃騎諮議參軍。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p001:m0026"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p002:r0006","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi:p002","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"父","person_id":"03n_n2r_8rt_C","referent_role":"third_person","quote":"長之年十五喪父，有孝性，哀感傍人。服除，蔬食者猶積載。閑居篤學，未嘗有惰容。初為諸府參軍，除員外散騎侍郎。母老，求補襄垣令，督郵無禮，鞭之，去職。尋補廬陵王義真車騎行正參軍，平越長史，東莞太守。入為尚書殿中郎，出為武昌太守。時王弘為江州，雅相知重，引為車騎從事中郎。入為太子中舍人，中書侍郎，以母老固辭朝直，補彭城王義康平北諮議參軍。元嘉九年，遷臨川內史，以南土卑濕，母年老，非所宜，辭不就。十一年，復除臨海太守。至郡少時而母亡，葬畢，不勝憂，十四年，卒，時年五十九。","note":"依本段敘事、稱謂及語者受者定。","chapter_id":"c-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi","book_id":"b-songshu-092","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-092-ruanchangzhi-ws2195614"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p002","text":"裕曰：「雖屢辭王命，非敢爲髙也。吾少無宦情，兼拙於人間，既不能躬耕自活，必有所資，故曲躬二郡。豈以騁能，私計故耳。」年六十二卒。三子：傭、寧、普。","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p002:m0000","surface":"裕","start":0,"end":1,"person_id":"03n_n2r_8rt","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-049-ruanyu-family:p002:m0067","surface":"傭","start":67,"end":68,"person_id":"03n_n2r_8rt_A","kind":"person","status":"contextual